Common Business Regions:
EMEA: Europe, Middle East, and Africa.
APAC: Asia-Pacific (East Asia, South Asia, Southeast Asia, Oceania).
LATAM: Latin America (South America, Central America, Caribbean).
NA/NAMER: North America (USA, Canada, sometimes Mexico).
AMER: Americas (North, Central, South). 
Other Regional Groupings:
MENA: Middle East & North Africa.
MEA: Middle East & Africa (sometimes used instead of EMEA).
UN Groups: African Group, Asia-Pacific Group, Eastern European Group, etc..
WHO Regions: African Region, European Region, Western Pacific Region, etc.. 
